---
title: The Crew
description: "Meet the Pest Tech crew: the folks who show up at your house in Chattanooga and answer your calls."
navKey: team
permalink: /team.html
---
<h1>The Crew</h1>
<p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:26px">These are the folks who show up at your house and answer your calls.</p>
<div class="crew">
  {%- for m in team %}
  <div class="member">
    <div class="portrait"{% if m.silly %} tabindex="0"{% endif %}>
      {%- if m.serious %}
      <img src="/assets/img/team/{{ m.serious }}" alt="{{ m.seriousAlt or m.name }}" width="400" height="460" loading="lazy">
      {%- if m.silly %}
      <img class="silly" src="/assets/img/team/{{ m.silly }}" alt="{{ m.sillyAlt or (m.name + ', off duty') }}" width="400" height="460" loading="lazy">
      {%- endif %}
      {%- else %}
      <div class="portrait-empty">photo coming</div>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="member-name">{{ m.name }}</div>
    {%- if m.role %}
    <div class="member-role">{{ m.role }}</div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
{#- The hover hint only shows once someone has a silly photo to swap in. #}
{%- if team | selectattr("silly") | length %}
<p class="caption" style="margin-bottom:22px">Tap/hover to catch us off duty.</p>
{%- endif %}
<hr>
<p class="center">Want to join the crew? <a href="/jobs">We hire A-grade attitudes →</a></p>
